# monitoring.cidr — uptime/monitoring source ranges that must never be blocked.
# One IP or CIDR per line. Blank lines and #comments ignored. These are checked
# as part of the never-block allowlist. Add your own monitors here.
#
# The lists below are convenience defaults — verify against each vendor's
# published ranges, which change over time.

# UptimeRobot (https://uptimerobot.com/ — published IP list)
# (intentionally left for the operator to populate; ranges change)

# Pingdom probe servers
# StatusCake
# BetterStack / Better Uptime
# Cloudflare Health Checks are covered by the Cloudflare range allowlist.
